## What's happening?
The BYOC exporter `{{exporter.name}}` (matched by `${byoc_exporter}`) failed to enqueue **{{value}} log records** during the last 15 minutes: its sending queue was full and rejected the batch. Unlike the receiver and `memory_limiter` signals, this one is attributable to the BYOC path.
{{/is_alert}}
{{#is_recovery}}The BYOC exporter `{{exporter.name}}` is accepting records into its sending queue again.{{/is_recovery}}

